      "text": "Herpes zoster:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " valacyclovir 1 g three times daily for 7 days (most effective within 48 hours of rash), or acyclovir 800 mg every 4 hours, 5 times daily for 7 to 10 days. Chickenpox in children 2 years and older: acyclovir 20 mg/kg per dose 4 times daily for 5 days (over 40 kg: adult dose)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
